## `assert.doesNotThrow(fn[, error][, message])`
<!-- YAML
added: v0.1.21
changes:
  - version: v5.11.0, v4.4.5
    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/2407
    description: The `message` parameter is respected now.
