## `assert.fail(actual, expected[, message[, operator[, stackStartFn]]])`
<!-- YAML
added: v0.1.21
changes:
  - version: v10.0.0
    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/18418
    description: Calling `assert.fail()` with more than one argument is
